# One line ending on both machines (2026-10-29, the Windows test run): code and text are LF everywhere, so the same
# file reads the same on the Mac, on the PC and in a release.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.bin binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
tools/git-hooks/* text eol=lf
